{"seq":1,"mint":"C12","verb":"claim","status":"ok","model":"openai/gpt-5.6-luna","approach":"split","literals":true,"findings":[{"kind":"contradicts","clause":"it is id-shape-agnostic (a `C\\d+` regex would miss real ids of the `R-ROOT` / `CYC-A` shape the crate's own fixtures use, a genuine false-negative class)","clause_quoted":true,"facts":["F10"],"quoted_from":"output","evidence":"fn is_citation_shaped(id: &str) -> bool {\n    id.starts_with(|c: char| c.is_ascii_uppercase())\n        && id.bytes().any(|b| b.is_ascii_digit() || b == b'-')\n}","why":"The matcher is explicitly dependent on identifier shape: it requires an ASCII-uppercase initial character and at least one digit or hyphen. That is incompatible with calling it shape-agnostic, even though it accepts the cited R-ROOT and CYC-A examples.","quoted":true}],"at":1790111965,"cost":0.0027142879999999996,"elapsed_ms":19237,"attempts":4,"not_verbatim":0,"literals_refuted":0,"not_a_quantity":0,"kind_off_verb":0,"refuted":0,"typed_versions":["jev-1.13.0"],"gate_calls":1,"typed_classify_calls":1,"typed_literal_calls":1}
